2. Objective
The objective of this project is to validate the functionality, reliability, accuracy, and performance of the Exchange Rate API using Postman. The testing ensures that all endpoints return correct responses for valid requests, appropriate error messages for invalid requests, and accurate exchange rate calculations.
3. Scope
The following Exchange Rate API functionalities are covered:
•	Fetch Latest Exchange Rates
•	Change Base Currency
•	Filter Target Currency
•	Historical Exchange Rate
•	Exchange Rate Over a Period
•	Exchange Rate for Date Range
•	Time Series (Daily)
•	Time Series Grouped by Month
•	Time Series Grouped by Week
•	Provider-wise Exchange Rates
•	Attribution Information
•	Export Exchange Rates as CSV
•	Single Currency Pair Exchange Rate
•	Available Currencies
•	Legacy Currencies with Scope
•	Currency Coverage
•	Data Sources
•	Multiple Currency Conversion
•	Latest Rate → Convert Amount
4. Test Objectives
The testing aims to verify:
•	API availability
•	Correct HTTP status codes
•	Response schema validation
•	Data accuracy
•	Currency conversion calculations
•	Historical data retrieval
•	CSV export functionality
•	Error handling
•	Data consistency
