10.Risks and Mitigation
Risk	Mitigation
Network issues	Re-run tests after connectivity is restored
API downtime	Monitor service status and retry later

11. Acceptance Criteria
1.	The Exchange Rate API Postman project will be considered successful when:
o	All test cases are executed successfully.
o	All endpoints return the expected HTTP status codes.
o	Response payloads conform to the documented JSON or CSV schema.
o	Currency conversion results are accurate based on the returned exchange rates.
o	Historical, latest, period-based, and time-series endpoints return complete and accurate data.
o	Invalid inputs produce appropriate validation messages and error codes.
o	API response times remain within the agreed performance threshold (for example, under 2 seconds).

